  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap rose 2.8% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $304.32B (2.8% higher over 30D) implies fresh dry powder entering crypto rails\u2014usually a constructive backdrop for settlement, trading, and on-chain cash demand. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/kraken-parent-payward-partners-with-sofi-stablecoin-247-settlement?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kraken parent Payward partners with SoFi on stablecoin, 24/7 settlement</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/regulation/wyoming-stable-token-chainlink-proof-of-reserve-frnt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wyoming Puts Its Stablecoin Reserves Onchain With Under $1 Million Outstanding</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Policy and reserves are resetting issuer priorities:</strong> Issuer and platform share can shift before aggregate market cap does, because policy and reserve quality determine which names institutions will hold. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/09/04/south-korea-targets-february-2027-rollout-for-full-tokenized-securities-market\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">South Korea targets February 2027 rollout for full tokenized securities market</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
